  "notes": "Every mesh is duplicated from its AI-allowed pack into /Game/EnvKit/Fab/<Map>/SM_EnvFab_<Name> (the pack folders stay pristine; the cooker follows the hard references of the duplicates and their MIs into the packs, DefaultGame.ini cooks /Game/EnvKit). Slots with a 'night' material get that night MI; trunk / bark slots keep the pack material (nothing to mute, already dark). Pack materials without colour parameters are copied once to /Game/EnvKit/Fab/Shared/M_EnvFab_* ('wrap': BaseColor -> lerp(luma, rgb, NightSaturation) x NightValue, defaults 1 = the pack look) and their night MIs are children of the copy; the parametrised pack MIs (Fantasy_Forest Mi_Foliage_01 / MI_rocks_Inst, Vine_Plants MM_Creepers_0x) get direct child MIs. bboxMin / bboxMax: the pack mesh bounds at scale 1 (UE local cm; the pivot is the pack pivot - the trunk base for the trees, NOT the bounds centre); base: the trunk / root footprint box [x0, y0, x1, y1] at scale 1 (layout_check check 5), null = the whole bounds footprint; tris: LOD0 (scout inventory, UE 5.8). The NoAI packs never appear here (UserVariant overlay only).",
